• You collaborate with external partners, such as attorneys, enforcement officers, and debt recovery agencies, across three different legal territories while tracking the status of ongoing cases; 

• You maintain precise and current records of all recovery actions and their outcomes in the company’s systems; 

• You identify and report any recurring trends or systemic issues in the portfolios to the Finance Manager for further analysis; 

